     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi <div><br></div><div>I have got the following output when testing multivariate normality using mardia. I&#39;m aware that this implies multivariate non-normaility because of the p value, but please could someone tell me what the b1p value relates to and what you would expect this to be?</div><div><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Mardia\r\ntests of multivariate skew and kurtosis<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Use\r\ndescribe(x) the to get univariate tests<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">n.obs\r\n= 357   num.vars =  74 <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">b1p\r\n=  1390.21   skew = \r\n82717.63  with probability =  0<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"> small sample skew =  83431.38 \r\nwith probability =  0<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">b2p\r\n=  5870.45   kurtosis = \r\n21.95  with probability =  0<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Thanks</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Emma.</span></p></div></div>"
